    "topo": {
      "accesAval": "Leave the A13 road at the exit 26 and drive in the Avers-Valley. At the end of the village Innerferrera turn left and cross the Averser-Rhein on a small bridge paralell to the main bridge.\n\nAfter passing a sawmill turn right and continue on that road for 550m.\n\nPark the car just after the last bridge of the Ual da Niemet.",
      "accesAmont": null,
      "approche": "Walk all the way back to the sawmill and follow up the road. At the third bend at 1625Hm, follow a hiking path slightly downwards to the bridge.\n\nStart a bit above the bridge by climbing down the steep grass board.",
      "descente": "The canyon offers some very nice slides.\n\nPerfect shaped T10+S2, followed by T9 and 3 x S6 jumps + a very nice T25 and the final jump S10/S12 in the lake offer a lot of action.\n\nSlide the T25 only higher as T15 and with a flat landing otherwise you will touch the rock.\n\nSeveral slides and jumps can be repeated.",
      "retour": "Climbing up the steep RD of the canyon from the lake.",
